      "text": "[ PASSOFF- 124 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(My Dream Vacation)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Many of my friends have been overseas on vacations."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My dream vacation is to travel abroad to an English-speaking"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "country."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I have been learning English for three years from my private"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "academy teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He is Canadian and has been telling us a lot about Canada."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I would love to go there sometime in the future so that I can use"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "all of the English I have learned."
    },
